{#
  EN | ONE CARD FOR ONE ROLE, in the `media` and `audio` slots.
  EN |
  EN | TWO KINDS OF ABSENCE, and telling them apart is the whole reason this
  EN | partial exists.
  EN |   - A role DECLARED WITHOUT AN ENTITY - the console nobody has wired
  EN |     up yet - still draws its card, at full size, greyed, saying "not
  EN |     connected". Decided at GENERATE time, because the model knows.
  EN |   - A role whose entity is there but does NOT SUPPORT a control - the
  EN |     amplifier that publishes no sound_mode_list - draws the control
  EN |     greyed, saying "not available". Decided at RENDER time, in the
  EN |     browser, by reading the live attributes.
  EN |
  EN | That second one is why the capability checks are button-card `[[[ ]]]`
  EN | templates rather than Jinja. Jinja runs once, when the dashboard is
  EN | written; the attributes it would read are whatever the amplifier
  EN | happened to publish that minute. Reading them in the browser means the
  EN | day the integration finally exposes the sound modes, they appear on
  EN | their own - no regeneration, no edit here. The same card serves the
  EN | poor integration and the rich one.
  EN |
  EN | WHAT THIS PARTIAL NEVER DOES: hide something. A missing device and a
  EN | missing capability both keep their space. The layout of a living room
  EN | is settled the day it is declared, and connecting hardware later only
  EN | fills it in.
  FR | UNE CARTE POUR UN ROLE, dans les tableaux `media` et `audio`.
  FR |
  FR | DEUX SORTES D ABSENCE, et les distinguer est toute la raison d etre de
  FR | ce partial.
  FR |   - Un role DECLARE SANS ENTITE - la console que personne n a encore
  FR |     branchee - dessine quand meme sa carte, pleine taille, grisee, avec
  FR |     la mention « non connecte ». Decide a la GENERATION, parce que le
  FR |     modele le sait.
  FR |   - Un role dont l entite existe mais NE SUPPORTE PAS une commande -
  FR |     l ampli qui ne publie aucun sound_mode_list - dessine la commande
  FR |     grisee, avec « non disponible ». Decide au RENDU, dans le
  FR |     navigateur, en lisant les attributs vivants.
  FR |
  FR | Ce second cas est la raison pour laquelle les tests de capacite sont
  FR | des templates button-card `[[[ ]]]` et non du Jinja. Jinja ne tourne
  FR | qu une fois, a l ecriture du dashboard ; les attributs qu il lirait
  FR | seraient ceux que l ampli publiait cette minute-la. Les lire dans le
  FR | navigateur fait que le jour ou l integration expose enfin les modes
  FR | sonores, ils apparaissent seuls - sans regeneration ni retouche ici.
  FR | La meme carte sert l integration pauvre et la riche.
  FR |
  FR | CE QUE CE PARTIAL NE FAIT JAMAIS : masquer quelque chose. Un appareil
  FR | absent et une capacite absente gardent tous deux leur place. La mise en
  FR | page d un salon est arretee le jour ou on la declare, et brancher du
  FR | materiel ensuite ne fait que la remplir.
#}

{# ------------------------------------------------------------------ #}
{# EN | The card frame: title, state line, then whatever the role needs #}
{# FR | Le cadre de la carte : titre, ligne d etat, puis le role        #}
{# ------------------------------------------------------------------ #}
{% macro tile(role, label, icon, locale) %}
{% set connected = role.entity | length > 0 %}
                    - type: custom:button-card
                      template: vssp_panel
                      show_icon: false
                      show_name: false
                      show_label: false
                      styles:
                        card:
                          - padding: 10px 12px
                          {% if not connected %}
                          {# EN | Greyed, not hidden, and not interactive:
                             EN | the card is a promise of where the device
                             EN | will be, so it must not look clickable.
                             FR | Grisee, pas masquee, et non interactive :
                             FR | la carte promet ou l appareil sera, elle ne
                             FR | doit donc pas avoir l air cliquable. #}
                          - opacity: 0.45
                          - cursor: default
                          {% endif %}
                        grid:
                          - grid-template-areas: '"body"'
                        custom_fields:
                          body:
                            - width: 100%
                      tap_action:
                        action: none
                      custom_fields:
                        body:
                          card:
                            type: vertical-stack
                            cards:
                              - type: custom:button-card
                                template: vssp_subsection_title
                                icon: {{ icon }}
                                name: "{{ label }}"
{% if not connected %}
                              - type: custom:button-card
                                show_icon: false
                                show_state: false
                                name: "{{ t('slot.not_connected') }}"
                                tap_action:
                                  action: none
                                styles:
                                  card:
                                    - background: transparent
                                    - box-shadow: none
                                    - border: none
                                    - padding: 14px 4px
                                    - cursor: default
                                  name:
                                    - font-size: calc(12px * var(--vssp-scale-label, 1))
                                    - color: rgba(143,182,201,0.75)
                                    - letter-spacing: 1px
                                    - text-transform: uppercase
{% else %}
{{ caller() }}
{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}


{# ------------------------------------------------------------------ #}
{# EN | A row of chips driven by a live attribute list (source_list).   #}
{# EN | `only` keeps the chips whose name matches one of the declared   #}
{# EN | values, so the TV shows four apps and three inputs in two tidy  #}
{# EN | rows rather than one pile of everything webOS reports.          #}
{# FR | Une rangee de pastilles pilotee par une liste d attributs vivante #}
{# FR | (source_list). `only` ne garde que les pastilles dont le nom     #}
{# FR | figure parmi les valeurs declarees : la TV montre donc quatre    #}
{# FR | applications et trois entrees en deux rangees nettes plutot qu un #}
{# FR | tas de tout ce que webOS rapporte.                               #}
{# ------------------------------------------------------------------ #}
{% macro source_chips(entity, only, title, locale) %}
                              - type: custom:button-card
                                template: vssp_subsection_title
                                name: "{{ title }}"
                                styles:
                                  card:
                                    - padding-top: 6px
{% if only %}
                              - type: grid
                                columns: {{ 4 if only | length > 3 else only | length }}
                                square: false
                                cards:
{% for value in only %}
                                  - type: custom:button-card
                                    entity: {{ entity }}
                                    name: "{{ value }}"
                                    show_icon: false
                                    show_state: false
                                    {# EN | Lit when this is the current
                                       EN | source, and greyed out entirely
                                       EN | when the entity does not offer it
                                       EN | - a button that cannot work must
                                       EN | say so rather than fail on press.
                                       FR | Allumee quand c est la source
                                       FR | courante, et grisee entierement
                                       FR | quand l entite ne la propose pas -
                                       FR | un bouton qui ne peut pas marcher
                                       FR | doit le dire plutot qu echouer au
                                       FR | clic. #}
                                    styles:
                                      card:
                                        - padding: 7px 4px
                                        - border-radius: 10px
                                        - font-size: calc(11px * var(--vssp-scale-label, 1))
                                        - background: >
                                            [[[
                                              const l = entity.attributes.source_list || [];
                                              if (!l.includes("{{ value }}")) return "rgba(255,255,255,.03)";
                                              return entity.attributes.source === "{{ value }}"
                                                ? "rgba(0,229,255,.18)" : "rgba(0,0,0,.25)";
                                            ]]]
                                        - border: >
                                            [[[
                                              const l = entity.attributes.source_list || [];
                                              if (!l.includes("{{ value }}")) return "1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06)";
                                              return entity.attributes.source === "{{ value }}"
                                                ? "1px solid #00E5FF" : "1px solid rgba(0,229,255,.18)";
                                            ]]]
                                        - opacity: >
                                            [[[
                                              const l = entity.attributes.source_list || [];
                                              return l.includes("{{ value }}") ? "1" : "0.35";
                                            ]]]
                                      name:
                                        - color: "#DCEEF6"
                                    tap_action:
                                      action: call-service
                                      service: media_player.select_source
                                      service_data:
                                        entity_id: {{ entity }}
                                        source: "{{ value }}"
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}


{# ------------------------------------------------------------------ #}
{# EN | Power + volume, the two controls every AV device supports.     #}
{# FR | Marche/arret + volume, les deux commandes que tout appareil AV  #}
{# FR | supporte.                                                       #}
{# ------------------------------------------------------------------ #}
{% macro transport(entity, locale) %}
                              - type: grid
                                columns: 4
                                square: false
                                cards:
                                  - type: custom:button-card
                                    entity: {{ entity }}
                                    icon: mdi:power
                                    show_name: false
                                    show_state: false
                                    size: 20px
                                    styles:
                                      card:
                                        - padding: 8px
                                        - border-radius: 10px
                                        - background: rgba(0,0,0,.25)
                                        - border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,255,.18)
                                      icon:
                                        - color: >
                                            [[[ return entity.state === "off"
                                                  ? "rgba(143,182,201,.6)" : "#00FFC3"; ]]]
                                    {# EN | A TV that cannot be woken must not offer a button
                                       EN | that pretends it can. webOS advertises TURN_OFF and
                                       EN | NOT TURN_ON unless Wake-on-LAN is configured with the
                                       EN | set MAC address, so while it is off the toggle would
                                       EN | raise "not supported" the moment it is pressed.
                                       EN | Greyed at render time from the live feature bitmask:
                                       EN | the day WoL is set up, it lights on its own.
                                       FR | Une TV qu on ne peut pas reveiller ne doit pas offrir
                                       FR | un bouton qui pretend le contraire. webOS annonce
                                       FR | TURN_OFF et PAS TURN_ON tant que le Wake-on-LAN n est
                                       FR | pas configure avec la MAC du televiseur : eteinte, la
                                       FR | bascule leverait « non supporte » des qu on la presse.
                                       FR | Grisee au rendu depuis le masque de capacites vivant :
                                       FR | le jour ou WoL est pose, elle s allume d elle-meme. #}
                                        - opacity: >
                                            [[[
                                              const f = entity.attributes.supported_features || 0;
                                              return (entity.state === "off" && !(f & 128)) ? "0.3" : "1";
                                            ]]]
                                    tap_action:
                                      action: call-service
                                      service: media_player.toggle
                                      service_data:
                                        entity_id: {{ entity }}
                                  - type: custom:button-card
                                    entity: {{ entity }}
                                    icon: mdi:volume-minus
                                    show_name: false
                                    show_state: false
                                    size: 20px
                                    styles:
                                      card:
                                        - padding: 8px
                                        - border-radius: 10px
                                        - background: rgba(0,0,0,.25)
                                        - border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,255,.18)
                                    tap_action:
                                      action: call-service
                                      service: media_player.volume_down
                                      service_data:
                                        entity_id: {{ entity }}
                                  - type: custom:button-card
                                    entity: {{ entity }}
                                    icon: mdi:volume-plus
                                    show_name: false
                                    show_state: false
                                    size: 20px
                                    styles:
                                      card:
                                        - padding: 8px
                                        - border-radius: 10px
                                        - background: rgba(0,0,0,.25)
                                        - border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,255,.18)
                                    tap_action:
                                      action: call-service
                                      service: media_player.volume_up
                                      service_data:
                                        entity_id: {{ entity }}
                                  - type: custom:button-card
                                    entity: {{ entity }}
                                    icon: mdi:volume-off
                                    show_name: false
                                    show_state: false
                                    size: 20px
                                    styles:
                                      card:
                                        - padding: 8px
                                        - border-radius: 10px
                                        - background: rgba(0,0,0,.25)
                                        - border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,255,.18)
                                      icon:
                                        - color: >
                                            [[[ return entity.attributes.is_volume_muted
                                                  ? "#FF4D6D" : "rgba(143,182,201,.8)"; ]]]
                                    tap_action:
                                      action: call-service
                                      service: media_player.volume_mute
                                      service_data:
                                        entity_id: {{ entity }}
                                        is_volume_muted: >
                                          [[[ return !entity.attributes.is_volume_muted; ]]]
{% endmacro %}


{# ------------------------------------------------------------------ #}
{# EN | The sound format row. The ONE control in this room with no      #}
{# EN | equivalent elsewhere in the project, and the one most likely to #}
{# EN | be missing: it exists only if the integration publishes         #}
{# EN | sound_mode_list. Rendered either way, and it says which.        #}
{# FR | La rangee du format sonore. LA commande de cette piece qui n a  #}
{# FR | aucun equivalent ailleurs dans le projet, et la plus susceptible #}
{# FR | de manquer : elle n existe que si l integration publie           #}
{# FR | sound_mode_list. Rendue dans les deux cas, et elle dit lequel.   #}
{# ------------------------------------------------------------------ #}
{% macro sound_mode(entity, locale) %}
                              - type: custom:button-card
                                template: vssp_subsection_title
                                name: "{{ t('slot.media_sound_mode') }}"
                                styles:
                                  card:
                                    - padding-top: 6px
                              - type: custom:button-card
                                entity: {{ entity }}
                                show_icon: false
                                show_state: false
                                name: >
                                  [[[
                                    const modes = entity.attributes.sound_mode_list;
                                    if (!modes || !modes.length) return "{{ t('slot.not_available') }}";
                                    return entity.attributes.sound_mode || "—";
                                  ]]]
                                styles:
                                  card:
                                    - padding: 9px 12px
                                    - border-radius: 10px
                                    - background: >
                                        [[[
                                          const m = entity.attributes.sound_mode_list;
                                          return (m && m.length) ? "rgba(0,0,0,.25)" : "rgba(255,255,255,.03)";
                                        ]]]
                                    - border: >
                                        [[[
                                          const m = entity.attributes.sound_mode_list;
                                          return (m && m.length) ? "1px solid rgba(0,229,255,.18)"
                                                                 : "1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06)";
                                        ]]]
                                    - cursor: >
                                        [[[
                                          const m = entity.attributes.sound_mode_list;
                                          return (m && m.length) ? "pointer" : "default";
                                        ]]]
                                  name:
                                    - font-size: calc(12px * var(--vssp-scale-value, 1))
                                    - color: >
                                        [[[
                                          const m = entity.attributes.sound_mode_list;
                                          return (m && m.length) ? "#00E5FF" : "rgba(143,182,201,0.6)";
                                        ]]]
                                    - letter-spacing: 1px
                                {# EN | more-info is the right target here: Home
                                   EN | Assistant's own dialog already lists
                                   EN | sound modes when they exist, and
                                   EN | reimplementing that picker here would
                                   EN | be a second thing to keep correct.
                                   FR | more-info est la bonne cible : la
                                   FR | boite de dialogue de Home Assistant
                                   FR | liste deja les modes sonores quand ils
                                   FR | existent, et reimplementer ce
                                   FR | selecteur ici serait une seconde chose
                                   FR | a maintenir juste. #}
                                tap_action:
                                  action: more-info
{% endmacro %}

{# ------------------------------------------------------------------ #}
{# EN | WHERE THE TELEVISION SOUND COMES OUT. Not a media_player        #}
{# EN | control at all: webOS exposes it as its own attribute,          #}
{# EN | `sound_output`, switched with webostv.select_sound_output.      #}
{# EN | This is the honest answer to "choose the speaker" in a living   #}
{# EN | room whose amplifier is fed by the television: the set decides  #}
{# EN | whether it plays through itself or through the Marantz, and     #}
{# EN | nothing on the amplifier side can report that choice.           #}
{# EN | The values are machine tokens (tv_external_speaker), so each one #}
{# EN | carries the words to print beside it.                           #}
{# FR | OU SORT LE SON DU TELEVISEUR. Pas une commande media_player du  #}
{# FR | tout : webOS l expose comme son propre attribut, `sound_output`, #}
{# FR | bascule par webostv.select_sound_output.                        #}
{# FR | C est la reponse honnete a « choisir l enceinte » dans un salon #}
{# FR | dont l ampli est alimente par le televiseur : c est le poste qui #}
{# FR | decide s il joue par lui-meme ou par le Marantz, et rien du cote #}
{# FR | de l ampli ne peut rapporter ce choix.                          #}
{# FR | Les valeurs sont des jetons machine (tv_external_speaker) :      #}
{# FR | chacune porte donc les mots a afficher a cote.                   #}
{# ------------------------------------------------------------------ #}
{% macro sound_outputs(entity, values, locale) %}
{% if values %}
                              - type: custom:button-card
                                template: vssp_subsection_title
                                name: "{{ t('slot.media_output') }}"
                                styles:
                                  card:
                                    - padding-top: 6px
                              - type: grid
                                columns: {{ 3 if values | length > 2 else values | length }}
                                square: false
                                cards:
{% for value in values %}
                                  - type: custom:button-card
                                    entity: {{ entity }}
                                    name: "{{ value.label }}"
                                    show_icon: false
                                    show_state: false
                                    styles:
                                      card:
                                        - padding: 7px 4px
                                        - border-radius: 10px
                                        - font-size: calc(11px * var(--vssp-scale-label, 1))
                                        - background: >
                                            [[[ return entity.attributes.sound_output === "{{ value.id }}"
                                                  ? "rgba(0,229,255,.18)" : "rgba(0,0,0,.25)"; ]]]
                                        - border: >
                                            [[[ return entity.attributes.sound_output === "{{ value.id }}"
                                                  ? "1px solid #00E5FF" : "1px solid rgba(0,229,255,.18)"; ]]]
                                      name:
                                        - color: "#DCEEF6"
                                    tap_action:
                                      action: call-service
                                      service: webostv.select_sound_output
                                      service_data:
                                        entity_id: {{ entity }}
                                        sound_output: "{{ value.id }}"
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}
